{
  "format": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "TUT_ADDON_ARCANEARTERIES",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcanearteries.tut_addon_arcanearteries.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "奥法献祭学是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcanearteries.tut_addon_arcanearteries.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "这是神秘时代与"
                },
                {
                  "text": "血魔法",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "（Blood Magic）之间的桥梁。你可以用法杖里的魔力代替自己的生命，为血魔法支付生命源质，也可以用神秘匕首献祭怪物。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcanearteries.tut_addon_arcanearteries.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcanearteries.tut_addon_arcanearteries.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcanearteries:DAGGER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘采血术，用魔力代替生命值采血。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcanearteries:SACRIFICEDAGGER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：怪物之血，更高效的献祭。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcanearteries:SLATE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "、"
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcanearteries:RUNE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘石板与神秘符文，为血之祭坛提供新的材料和符文。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/text/6",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcanearteries.tut_addon_arcanearteries.text.6",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "安装了植物魔法时，还可以使用以魔力（mana）为代价的版本。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "forge:mod_loaded",
              "modid": "botania"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/text/7",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcanearteries.tut_addon_arcanearteries.text.7",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "安装了 EvilCraft 时，还可以使用以血液为代价的版本。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "forge:mod_loaded",
              "modid": "evilcraft"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/recommended/divider",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/recommended/title",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "thaumcraft.tutorial.recommended"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcanearteries:tut_addon_arcanearteries/recommended/icons",
